      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْلُودٌ</span></b>  [<i>Having his skin hit, hurt,</i> or <i>beaten:
flogged:</i> &amp;c. : see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلِيدٌ</span>]. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مَجْلُودَةٌ</span>
<i>Land affected,</i> or <i>smitten, by hoar-frost,</i> or <i>rime.</i>
(S, A, L, Msb, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْلُودٌ</span> is also an inf. n.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَلُدَ</span> [q. v.]. (S, L, K.)

